    <p>Values come from <code>cad.metricThread(size)</code>, <code>clearanceHole(size, fit)</code> and <code>tapDrill(size)</code>; the M6 row was queried through the two helpers only. Related rules, with real results for an M6 screw and its Ø6.6 clearance hole:</p>
